sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant R as routes/chat.py (the loop)
    participant G as gateway.generate()
    participant M as Model
    participant S as schemas.py (Pydantic)
    participant T as MCP tool server
    U->>R: "What are Acme's open deals?"
    R->>G: messages + tool definitions
    G->>M: request with tools
    M-->>G: tool call get_open_deals {company_name: Acme}
    G-->>R: ToolCall (arguments parsed)
    R->>S: validate arguments
    alt valid
        R->>T: run the tool
        T-->>R: result (deals)
    else invalid, unknown or failed
        R-->>R: error text as the tool result
    end
    R->>G: messages + tool result (tool message, same call id)
    G->>M: request
    M-->>G: final answer text
    G-->>R: GenerationResult (no tool calls)
    R-->>U: answer + toolsUsed + guardrail
